        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped with no memory and no other way out, there is no choice but to ascend this massive mysterious tower. Your climb demands perfection, but is the fear of falling stopping you from achieving your goals  ?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137090/extras/b2078301a0539b5cf147344eee2f7143.webp?t=1764260620\" width=600 height=34 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137090/extras/2ddad403e440ef6513dfb7fab57fd522.poster.avif?t=1764260620\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137090/extras/2ddad403e440ef6513dfb7fab57fd522.webm?t=1764260620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137090/extras/2ddad403e440ef6513dfb7fab57fd522.mp4?t=1764260620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Echelon is a first-person platformer with a unique  mechanic. Without the ability to jump, you will have to push yourself off the ground and walls in order to reach the top.<strong> </strong>   <br>   <br>    <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137090/extras/28e506426ad64a30cd7c6b7dc9fb5fdc.webp?t=1764260620\" width=600 height=34 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137090/extras/5271d207e17eba59c20b9cc955264661.poster.avif?t=1764260620\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137090/extras/5271d207e17eba59c20b9cc955264661.webm?t=1764260620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137090/extras/5271d207e17eba59c20b9cc955264661.mp4?t=1764260620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong> <br><strong> </strong>Explore different environments, each with their own unique twists. But be careful, one small mistake and you might have to retrace your steps from down below. <br><br><strong> </strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137090/extras/358c276766bc70808a3fae14f1ea75bb.webp?t=1764260620\" width=600 height=34 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journal pages from a previous climber can be found throughout the tower. Can this person's personal journey help understand why this tower exists? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137090/extras/b077bcfc69312a7286724c8c1dc8a8f7.webp?t=1764260620\" width=600 height=34 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seeking a true test of skill? Compete for the fastest time and challenge your limits against others. Find the shortcuts and fight for the top of the leaderboard!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped with no memory and no other way out, there is no choice but to ascend this massive mysterious tower. Your climb demands perfection, but is the fear of falling stopping you from achieving your goals  ?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137090/extras/b2078301a0539b5cf147344eee2f7143.webp?t=1764260620\" width=600 height=34 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137090/extras/2ddad403e440ef6513dfb7fab57fd522.poster.avif?t=1764260620\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137090/extras/2ddad403e440ef6513dfb7fab57fd522.webm?t=1764260620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137090/extras/2ddad403e440ef6513dfb7fab57fd522.mp4?t=1764260620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Echelon is a first-person platformer with a unique  mechanic. Without the ability to jump, you will have to push yourself off the ground and walls in order to reach the top.<strong> </strong>   <br>   <br>    <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137090/extras/28e506426ad64a30cd7c6b7dc9fb5fdc.webp?t=1764260620\" width=600 height=34 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137090/extras/5271d207e17eba59c20b9cc955264661.poster.avif?t=1764260620\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137090/extras/5271d207e17eba59c20b9cc955264661.webm?t=1764260620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137090/extras/5271d207e17eba59c20b9cc955264661.mp4?t=1764260620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong> <br><strong> </strong>Explore different environments, each with their own unique twists. But be careful, one small mistake and you might have to retrace your steps from down below. <br><br><strong> </strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137090/extras/358c276766bc70808a3fae14f1ea75bb.webp?t=1764260620\" width=600 height=34 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journal pages from a previous climber can be found throughout the tower. Can this person's personal journey help understand why this tower exists? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137090/extras/b077bcfc69312a7286724c8c1dc8a8f7.webp?t=1764260620\" width=600 height=34 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seeking a true test of skill? Compete for the fastest time and challenge your limits against others. Find the shortcuts and fight for the top of the leaderboard!</p>",
